# Web (`minirust-web`)

SSR-only Leptos (`features = ["ssr"]`), served by Axum. Do not add hydration, `cargo-leptos`, or WASM unless the user asks.

- Render with `view! { ... }.to_html()` and prefix `<!DOCTYPE html>`.
- Call application services/queries. Do not duplicate API business rules.
- Default development address is `127.0.0.1:3001`.
- Baseline routes: `GET /` (SSR landing page), `GET /health`.

## Responsive UI

- Every user-facing page MUST be responsive on mobile, tablet, and desktop.
- Use mobile-first Tailwind utilities and responsive variants such as `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, and `xl:`.
- Avoid fixed desktop widths and layouts that can create horizontal scrolling.
- Responsive navigation, typography, grids, spacing, and CTA layouts must be intentional.
- Include viewport metadata and preserve keyboard focus visibility.
- Prefer semantic HTML, accessible labels, and adequate contrast.
- Verify representative narrow, medium, and wide viewport behavior when browser tooling is available.

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS is the only CSS framework.
- No Bootstrap, DaisyUI, or ad-hoc inline styles.
- Tailwind Play CDN is development-only until a production CSS build pipeline is introduced.
